Design a premium digital wedding invitation platform with two main interfaces:
1. Guest-facing wedding invitation website
2. Admin dashboard for managing invitations

The product should feel like a modern luxury wedding SaaS platform.

Design style:
- Elegant luxury wedding aesthetic
- Minimalist but romantic
- Ivory, champagne gold, soft beige, white, and sage green color palette
- Premium typography using serif font for headings and modern sans-serif for body
- Smooth animations concept
- Mobile-first responsive design
- High-end wedding website inspiration
- Clean UI/UX, not overly decorative

---

PART 1: GUEST WEDDING INVITATION WEBSITE

Create a beautiful scrolling landing page.

## 1. Opening Cover

Design a full-screen hero section:

Elements:
- Wedding couple background photo
- Elegant overlay
- Couple names
- Wedding date
- Personalized guest greeting:

"Dear, [Guest Name]"

Button:
"Open Invitation"

Additional elements:
- Animated envelope opening concept
- Background music toggle button
- Minimal floating flower animation

---

## 2. Bride & Groom Section

Create elegant profile cards:

Bride:
- Portrait photo
- Full name
- Parents information

Groom:
- Portrait photo
- Full name
- Parents information

Add romantic quote section.

---

## 3. Countdown Section

Create luxury countdown component:

Display:
- Days
- Hours
- Minutes
- Seconds

Use elegant glass card style.

---

## 4. Wedding Event Details

Create two event cards:

Akad Nikah:
- Date
- Time
- Venue

Reception:
- Date
- Time
- Venue

Additional:
- Dress code
- Add to calendar button

---

## 5. Location Section

Create map section:

Elements:
- Google Maps preview
- Venue image
- Address
- Navigation button

---

## 6. Love Story Timeline

Create vertical timeline:

Example:

2019
First Meeting

2021
Our Journey Begins

2025
Engagement

2026
Wedding Day

Use elegant timeline animation.

---

## 7. Gallery Section

Create modern photo gallery:

Features:
- Masonry layout
- Pre-wedding photos
- Video highlight
- Fullscreen image preview

Additional unique feature:

Guest Photo Upload:

Button:
"Share Your Moment"

Allow guests to upload wedding photos through QR access.

---

## 8. RSVP Section

Create interactive RSVP form:

Fields:
- Guest name
- Attendance confirmation
- Number of guests
- Message

Options:
Yes, I will attend
Sorry, cannot attend

---

## 9. Guest Wishes Section

Create digital guestbook:

Features:
- Guest messages
- Heart reaction
- Beautiful message cards

---

## 10. Digital Gift Section

Create wedding gift area:

Cards:
- Bank transfer
- QRIS payment
- Copy account button

---

## 11. FAQ Section

Create accordion FAQ:

Questions:
- Event schedule
- Dress code
- Parking information
- Allowed guest number
- Location details

---

## 12. Wedding Memories Section

After wedding concept:

Create memory page:

- Wedding photos
- Videos
- Guest uploaded moments
- Thank you message

---

# PART 2: ADMIN DASHBOARD

Create desktop dashboard interface.

Style:
- Modern SaaS dashboard
- Luxury wedding branding
- Clean cards
- Responsive layout


## 1. Login Page

Create:

- Wedding logo
- Email input
- Password input
- Login button


---

## 2. Dashboard Overview

Create analytics dashboard.

Cards:

Total Guests
500

Invitation Opened
420

Confirmed RSVP
350

Checked In
300


Charts:
- Visitor statistics
- RSVP percentage
- Attendance analytics


---

## 3. Guest Management Page

Create guest table:

Columns:

Guest Name
Phone Number
Category
Invitation Link
RSVP Status
Check-in Status


Features:
- Add guest
- Search guest
- Filter
- Import guest list
- Export data


---

## 4. Personalized Invitation Link Generator

Create feature:

Generate unique invitation links:

Example:

wedding.com/invitation?guest=Andi


Display:

Guest name
Unique link
QR code


---

## 5. RSVP Management

Create RSVP monitoring:

Sections:

Confirmed guests
Pending responses
Declined guests


Add:
Send reminder button

---

## 6. QR Check-in System

Create reception management:

Features:

Generate QR code
Scan guest QR
Attendance tracking


Display:

Guest arrived:
250 people


---

## 7. Invitation CMS Editor

Create drag-and-drop editor:

Editable:

- Couple information
- Wedding details
- Story timeline
- Gallery
- Music
- Gift information


---

## 8. Theme Customization

Create theme builder:

Options:

Themes:
- Elegant Gold
- Garden Romance
- Minimal White
- Traditional Luxury


Customization:
- Colors
- Fonts
- Background
- Layout


---

## 9. Music Management

Create music settings:

Features:

Upload song
Select playlist
Autoplay ON/OFF
Volume control


---

## 10. Analytics Page

Create advanced analytics:

Show:

Invitation visits
Guest engagement
RSVP conversion
Most visited sections
Device statistics


---

FINAL DESIGN REQUIREMENTS:

- Create complete professional wedding invitation ecosystem
- Make it look like a real commercial product
- Prioritize user experience
- Elegant premium feeling
- Mobile invitation + desktop admin dashboard
- Include micro interactions
- Modern UI design
- Suitable for Figma prototype presentation